<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman cuts Crown Cork.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman cuts Crown Cork.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Lehman Brothers said it downgraded Crown Cork &amp; Seal Inc to outperform from buy.</p>
<p>--Lehman said it lowered its 1997 earnings estimate on Crown to $3.55 per share from $3.75, calling $3.75 a &quot;stretch target for 1997.&quot;</p>
<p>--Shares fell 5/8 to 46-3/8.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street Desk 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
